{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If the object is visible, move to it, pick it up, and check its properties, otherwise scan the area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />\"",
